    "body": "### Summary\n\n* Added ADR-0067 with the closed E1–E5 escalation list, exact owner-approved spec hash, delegated decision ledger, standing lease authorization, daily digest, and transition rules for delegated audits and merges. [docs/adr/0067-danh-sach-dong-va-uy-quyen-thuong-truc.mdL1-L64](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/blob/728aaac027b0e42daf09963ded246160986f62a1/docs/adr/0067-danh-sach-dong-va-uy-quyen-thuong-truc.md#L1-L64) [docs/adr/0067-danh-sach-dong-va-uy-quyen-thuong-truc.mdL175-L231](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/blob/728aaac027b0e42daf09963ded246160986f62a1/docs/adr/0067-danh-sach-dong-va-uy-quyen-thuong-truc.md#L175-L231)\n* Updated the multi-session protocol so authority questions follow ADR-0067, additional pushes no longer require an owner checkpoint, non-convergence checkpoints trigger reconsideration, and delegated land authorization is recognized under the specified conditions. [docs/PROTOCOL_DA_PHIEN.mdL56-L65](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/blob/728aaac027b0e42daf09963ded246160986f62a1/docs/PROTOCOL_DA_PHIEN.md#L56-L65) [docs/PROTOCOL_DA_PHIEN.mdL1108-L1131](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/blob/728aaac027b0e42daf09963ded246160986f62a1/docs/PROTOCOL_DA_PHIEN.md#L1108-L1131) [docs/PROTOCOL_DA_PHIEN.mdL1183-L1211](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/blob/728aaac027b0e42daf09963ded246160986f62a1/docs/PROTOCOL_DA_PHIEN.md#L1183-L1211)\n* Registered ADR-0067 in the protocol’s authoritative ADR table. [docs/PROTOCOL_DA_PHIEN.mdL1541-L1547](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/blob/728aaac027b0e42daf09963ded246160986f62a1/docs/PROTOCOL_DA_PHIEN.md#L1541-L1547)\n* Updated `soan-spec` to reference ADR-0067 rather than duplicate escalation definitions, require `pham_vi_e`, and document the independent-review freeze rule. [.claude/skills/soan-spec/SKILL.mdL127-L152](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/blob/728aaac027b0e42daf09963ded246160986f62a1/.claude/skills/soan-spec/SKILL.md#L127-L152) [.claude/skills/soan-spec/SKILL.mdL190-L200](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/blob/728aaac027b0e42daf09963ded246160986f62a1/.claude/skills/soan-spec/SKILL.md#L190-L200)\n* Committed the candidate as `2d8ae7a20e9121acc2b0e738fd63edba19a162c6` with tree `c51b7960ee1aa92d1b85ff6e63f4bef5f88f1f49`, and recorded the new pull-request metadata through `make_pr`.\n\n**Testing**\n\n* ✅ `python -B .claude/dev/packet_loop.py doctrine-scan --root .` — scanned 12 files with no duplicated doctrine.\n* ✅ `python -B .claude/dev/packet_loop.py adr-song --root .` — all 65 ADR files matched the 65 protocol entries.\n* ✅ `python -B scripts/tl.py --selftest` — `1777/1777`.\n* ✅ `git diff --check c0b8e11d7099f756e65db8bd9a81493cde789a6f HEAD`\n* ⚠️ `python /tmp/kiem_p2.py ops/specs/GIAM-HOI-P2-ADR-E1-E5-r10.md c0b8e11d7099f756e65db8bd9a81493cde789a6f` — not measurable because the supplied checkout is shallow.\n* ⚠️ `git fetch --unshallow origin` — the checkout has no configured `origin`, so history could not be expanded for the packet acceptance script.\n* ❌ `python -B scripts/tl.py doc-claims-check --strict` — reported two flags: a pre-existing missing commit claim and the exact-spec `.agents/skills/land-packets/SKILL.md` reference in ADR-0067 being parsed without its leading dot. That ADR text is byte-constrained by the approved packet specification. [docs/adr/0067-danh-sach-dong-va-uy-quyen-thuong-truc.mdL280-L288](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/blob/728aaac027b0e42daf09963ded246160986f62a1/docs/adr/0067-danh-sach-dong-va-uy-quyen-thuong-truc.md#L280-L288)\n\n [View task →](https://chatgpt.com/s/cd_6af802699d988191bbb9392f20049a47)",
